                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55854f2b-282d-452a-8008-7586f0f10ac9",
                                "sense_id": "5a1cf812-8564-3ee8-845e-ca89aaad96c0",
                                "text": "Са́мое стра́шное в де́де Амбо не его́ гипертрофи́рованное гостеприи́мство и да́же не жела́ние закорми́ть го́стя до беспа́мятства.",
                                "translation": "The scariest thing about Grandpa Ambo isn't his hypertrophic hospitality, nor even his desire to overfeed his guests to unconsciousness.",
                                "english": "The scariest thing about Grandpa Ambo isn't his hypertrophic hospitality, nor even his desire to overfeed his guests to unconsciousness."
                            }
                        ]
